        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: विषय",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विषय — viṣay — \"a subject, a topic\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर तुम्हें विज्ञान पसंद है तो वही विषय चुनो। agar tumhẽ vijñān pasand hai to vahī viṣay cuno. If you like science, choose that subject."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विषय (viṣay) is a tatsama, borrowed from Sanskrit viṣaya, \"a sphere, a scope\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
